@* Puts the page into reader mode (the immersive view that hides the surrounding chrome so the pinned ReaderBar
   stands in for it) while Active. It renders an .immersive-root marker that layout.css detects with :has(), so the
   chrome follows the DOM and restores itself the moment the marker is gone, with no enter/leave ordering to race. *@
@if (Active)
{
    <span class="immersive-root" hidden></span>
}

@code {
    /// <summary>Whether reader mode should be on; pages pass true once their item has loaded.</summary>
    [Parameter] public bool Active { get; set; }
}
